(A couple of weeks ago I went to Washington to contradict under the) Tj T*
(solemn obligation of my oath a gross and wanton calumny which, based) Tj T*
(upon nothing but anonymous and irresponsible gossip, had been uttered) Tj T*
(regarding my name.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(On my way between New York and Washington, thinking that, once on the) Tj T*
(stand, I might possibly be asked a number of questions more or less) Tj T*
(within the general scope of the Committee's enquiry, I indulged in a) Tj T*
(little mental exercise by putting myself through an imaginary) Tj T*
(examination.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(With your permission, I will read a few of these phantom questions and) Tj T*
(answers:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Should the Exchange Be "Regulated"?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Question:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_There is a fairly widespread impression that the functions of the) Tj T*
(Stock Exchange should be circumscribed and controlled by some) Tj T*
(governmental authority; that it needs reforming from without. What have) Tj T*
(you to say on that subject?_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Answer:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
