(I have no hesitation in saying that, on the whole, the New York Stock) Tj T*
(Exchange is the most efficient and best conducted organization of its) Tj T*
(kind in the world.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: _Should the Exchange be regulated?_]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The recommendations made by the Commission appointed by Governor Hughes) Tj T*
(at the time were immediately adopted in toto by the Stock Exchange.) Tj T*
(Certain abuses which were shown to have crept into its system several) Tj T*
(years ago were at once rectified. From time to time other failings will) Tj T*
(become apparent--there may be some in existence at this very moment) Tj T*
(which have escaped its attention--as failings become apparent in every) Tj T*
(institution, and will have to be met and corrected.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I am satisfied that in cases where public opinion or the proper) Tj T*
(authorities call attention to shortcomings which may be found to exist) Tj T*
(in the Stock Exchange practice, or where such may be discovered by the) Tj T*
(governing body or the membership of the Exchange, prompt correction can) Tj T*
(be safely relied upon.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Sometimes and in some respects, it is true, outside observers may have) Tj T*
(a clearer vision than those who are qualified by many years of) Tj T*
(experience, practice and routine.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If there be any measures which can be shown clearly to be conducive) Tj T*
(towards the better fulfilment of those purposes which the Stock) Tj T*
(Exchange is created and intended to serve, I am certain that the) Tj T*
(membership would not permit themselves to be led or influenced by) Tj T*
(hidebound Bourbonism, but would welcome such measures, from whatever) Tj T*
(quarter they may originate.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Is the Exchange Merely a Private Institution?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Question:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_Do I understand you to mean, then, that the Stock Exchange is simply) Tj T*
(a private institution and as such removed from the control of) Tj T*
(governmental authorities and of no concern to them?_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Answer:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I beg your pardon, but that is not the meaning I intended to convey.) Tj T*
(While the Stock Exchange is in theory a private institution, it) Tj T*
(fulfills in fact a public function of great national importance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(That function is to afford a free and fair, broad and genuine market) Tj T*
(for securities and particularly for the tokens of the industrial wealth) Tj T*
