(Short Selling--Is it Justifiable?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Question:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_You have commenced your first answer with the words, "I need not) Tj T*
(point out to your Commission." That is a complimentary assumption, but) Tj T*
(I don't mind telling you that we here are very little acquainted with) Tj T*
(the working of the Stock Exchange or the affairs of you Wall Street men) Tj T*
(in general. What about short selling?_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Answer:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I do not mean to take a "holier than thou" attitude, but personally, I) Tj T*
(have never sold a share of stock short in my life.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Short sellers are born, not made. But if there were not people born who) Tj T*
(sell short, they would almost have to be invented.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Short selling has a legitimate place in the scheme of things economic.) Tj T*
(It acts as a check on undue optimism, it tends to counteract the danger) Tj T*
(of an upward runaway market, it supplies a sustaining force in a) Tj T*
(heavily declining market at times of unexpected shock or panic. It is a) Tj T*
(valuable element in preventing extremes of advance and decline.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: _Short selling Is it justifiable?_]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The short seller contracts to deliver at a certain price a certain) Tj T*
(quantity of stocks which he does not own at the time, but which he) Tj T*
(expects the course of the market to permit him to buy at a profit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
