(Does the Public Get "Fleeced"?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Question:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_We hear or read from time to time about the public being fleeced.) Tj T*
(There is a good deal of smoke. Isn't there some fire?_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Answer:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If people do get "fleeced," the fault lies mainly with outside) Tj T*
(promoters or unscrupulous financiers, over whom the Stock Exchange has) Tj T*
(no effective control. Some people imagine themselves "fleeced," when) Tj T*
(the real trouble was their own get-rich-quick greed in buying highly) Tj T*
(speculative or unsound securities, or having gone into the market) Tj T*
(beyond their depth, or having exercised poor judgment as to the time of) Tj T*
(buying and selling. Against these causes I know of no effective remedy,) Tj T*
(just as there is no way to prevent a man from overeating or eating what) Tj T*
(is bad for him.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In saying this, I do not mean to imply that stockbrokers have not a) Tj T*
(duty in the premises.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: _Does the public get fleeced?_]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(On the contrary, they have a very distinct and comprehensive duty) Tj T*
(towards their clients, especially those less familiar with stock market) Tj T*
(and financial affairs, and towards the public at large. And they have) Tj T*
(furthermore the duty to abstain from tempting or unduly encouraging) Tj T*
(people to speculate on margin, especially people of limited means, and) Tj T*
(from accepting or continuing accounts which are not amply protected by) Tj T*
(margin. In respect of the latter requirement, the Stock Exchange has) Tj T*
(rightly increased the stringency of its rules some years ago, and it) Tj T*
(cannot too sternly set its face against an infringement of those rules) Tj T*
(or too vigilantly guard against their evasion.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Against unscrupulous promotion and financiering a remedy might be found) Tj T*
(in a law which should forbid any public dealing in any industrial) Tj T*
(security [for railroad and public service securities the existing) Tj T*
(Commissions afford ample protection to the public] unless its) Tj T*
(introduction is accompanied by a prospectus setting forth every) Tj T*
(material detail about the company concerned and the security offered,) Tj T*
(such prospectus to be signed by persons who are to be held responsible) Tj T*
